   "Crop-health escalation (flag-crop-health-concern always human) is a core
    design invariant"
   "Portable .cljc, zero JVM-only constructs, clj-kondo 0 errors / 0 warnings"]
  :negative
  ["Real persistent store (Datomic/kotoba-server) is a follow-up (in-memory for now)"
   "langgraph-clj StateGraph wiring (real interrupt-before/checkpoint resume) is
    deferred scaffolding, matching 0113's own stub status"
   "No new domain-specific Governor gate was added for this vertical (unlike
    0114/0116's ratoon-cycle/quality-grade checks) -- the task's domain design
    section specified the same hard-invariant/escalation shape as 0113 verbatim,
    so this actor is a direct crop-catalog adaptation rather than a novel gate"]}

